                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【Requests】[REQ AUD] - Kerli - Ollesummer Soundboard]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/kerli-ollesummer-soundboard.300710/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					I know few people had it or and it seems less knew of them, but there was the entire 2009 performance soundboard recordings, no audience sound and clear audio from Kerli, pre Red Flags leak it was the best sounding recording and closest to studio we had, same with I'll Find You. <br>
<br>
Does anyone still happen to have the files? I had them until my PC blew up in 2017, I took the hard drive out to save it but honestly can't remember if I wiped it without thinking or if I even can find it, so I'm trying to find someone else with them in case.<br>
Of course even if I find it and hadn't wiped it, I have no PC still to hook up the drive to soo yeah.<br>
<br>
If not let's hope I find it and still have it intact file wise and share them myself~
					<div class="messageTextEndMarker">&nbsp;</div>
				</blockquote>
			</article>]]></description>
